  faqs={[
    {
      question: "How much does recurring maid service cost in Florence?",
      answer: `Recurring maid service in Florence starts at ${RECURRING_PRICING.weekly.display} per visit for weekly cleaning. Weekly takes 30% off the regular rate, biweekly 25%, and monthly 15%. Your square footage and the type of cleaning set the exact price — not an hourly rate, not a guess. Call 256-826-1100, tell us your square footage, and you'll have your exact number before you hang up.`
    },
    {
      question: "Will the cleaning be consistent from visit to visit?",
      answer: "Yes. Every visit runs the same 44-item checklist, so the result doesn't depend on who's on the schedule that day. We keep notes on your home and preferences, and we try to keep the same team on your schedule. If we missed something, tell us within 24 hours and we'll schedule a re-clean right away, no charge."
    },
    {
      question: "What's the difference between weekly and biweekly cleaning?",
      answer: "Weekly cleaning keeps your home consistently clean with lighter cleaning each visit. Biweekly works well for smaller households or those who maintain tidiness between visits. Monthly is best suited for light maintenance or vacation homes."
    },
    {
      question: "Can I skip or reschedule a cleaning?",
      answer: "Absolutely! Life happens, and we understand. You can skip or reschedule cleanings with 24-48 hours notice at no charge. We'll work with you to find a time that fits your schedule."
    },
    {
      question: "Do you serve the UNA area?",
      answer: "Yes! We provide recurring maid service throughout Florence including near UNA, Downtown Florence, the Historic District, and all Lauderdale County neighborhoods. We also serve the wider Shoals area."
    },
    {
      question: "Should I start with a deep clean?",
      answer: "We recommend it! Starting with a deep clean gives our team a clean baseline to maintain. This makes recurring visits more efficient and ensures better results. Many Florence customers book a one-time deep clean, then transition to weekly or biweekly service."
    }
  ]}
